<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Mumbai Resto — The Future of Hospitality</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/main.css">
</head>
<body>
    <canvas id="particle-canvas"></canvas>

    <nav class="nav">
        <div class="logo nav-logo">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-plum-voltage)" stroke-width="2">
                <path d="M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5zM2 17l10 5 10-5M2 12l10 5 10-5"/>
            </svg>
            MUMBAI RESTO
        </div>
        <div class="nav-links">
            <a href="#features" class="nav-link">Features</a>
            <a href="#pricing" class="nav-link">Pricing</a>
            <a href="#faq" class="nav-link">FAQ</a>
            <a href="/admin/login" class="nav-link">Log In</a>
            <a href="/register" class="btn-primary nav-cta">Get Started</a>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <main class="container">
        <section class="hero">
            <div class="hero-content">
                <span class="eyebrow hero-eyebrow">BEYOND RESERVATIONS. BEYOND ORDERS.</span>
                <h1 class="display-headline">Your restaurant deserves a digital soul.</h1>
                <p class="body-text">QR table ordering, online bookings, beautiful storefronts, and a powerful admin dashboard. Everything Indian restaurants need to thrive in the digital age.</p>
                <div class="hero-actions">
                    <a href="/register" class="btn-primary">Start Your Free Trial</a>
                    <button class="btn-ghost">See How It Works</button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="features" class="section">
            <span class="eyebrow">Features</span>
            <h2 class="display-headline section-headline">Everything your restaurant needs.</h2>

            <div class="grid">
                <div class="card">
                    <span class="eyebrow card-step-01 card-number">01</span>
                    <h3 class="card-title">QR Table Ordering</h3>
                    <p class="card-description">Diners scan, browse, and order directly from their phone. No app download needed.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="card">
                    <span class="eyebrow card-step-02 card-number">02</span>
                    <h3 class="card-title">Table Booking System</h3>
                    <p class="card-description">Manage availability and party sizes effortlessly with instant confirmation.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="card">
                    <span class="eyebrow card-step-03 card-number">03</span>
                    <h3 class="card-title">Payments Built In</h3>
                    <p class="card-description">Accept UPI, cards, and wallets via Razorpay. Zero platform commission.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="card">
                    <span class="eyebrow card-number">04</span>
                    <h3 class="card-title">Kitchen Display</h3>
                    <p class="card-description">Real-time order queue for your kitchen staff. Track fulfillment instantly.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="card">
                    <span class="eyebrow card-number">05</span>
                    <h3 class="card-title">5 Beautiful Themes</h3>
                    <p class="card-description">Choose from Classic to Zen Minimal. Each template is mobile-optimized.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="card">
                    <span class="eyebrow card-number">06</span>
                    <h3 class="card-title">Multi-Branch</h3>
                    <p class="card-description">Manage multiple outlets from one dashboard with unified reporting.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="testimonials" class="section">
            <span class="eyebrow">The Voice of the Kitchen</span>
            <h2 class="display-headline section-headline">Trusted by India's finest chefs.</h2>

            <div class="grid">
                <div class="testimonial-card">
                    <p class="testimonial-quote">"Mumbai Resto gave our digital presence the same soul as our signature dishes. The transition was seamless."</p>
                    <div class="testimonial-author">
                        <div class="author-info">
                            <h4>Rajesh Malhotra</h4>
                            <p>Owner, The Saffron Table</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="testimonial-card">
                    <p class="testimonial-quote">"The QR ordering system doubled our efficiency during peak hours. Our staff can finally focus on hospitality, not order taking."</p>
                    <div class="testimonial-author">
                        <div class="author-info">
                            <h4>Priya Sharma</h4>
                            <p>Director, Spice & Soul Bistro</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="testimonial-card">
                    <p class="testimonial-quote">"Finally, a SaaS platform that understands the nuances of the Indian hospitality market. It's robust yet elegant."</p>
                    <div class="testimonial-author">
                        <div class="author-info">
                            <h4>Amit Deshmukh</h4>
                            <p>Founder, Bistro One Chain</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="faq" class="section">
            <span class="eyebrow">FAQ</span>
            <h2 class="display-headline section-headline">Curiosity served.</h2>

            <div class="faq-grid">
                <div class="faq-item">
                    <h3 class="faq-question">Do I need special hardware?</h3>
                    <p class="faq-answer">No. Mumbai Resto is a web-based platform that works on any smartphone, tablet, or PC. You can use your existing devices to manage orders and kitchen displays.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-item">
                    <h3 class="faq-question">Is there a transaction fee?</h3>
                    <p class="faq-answer">We charge zero commission on your orders. You only pay the standard payment gateway fees to Razorpay for processing online payments.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-item">
                    <h3 class="faq-question">Can I use my own domain?</h3>
                    <p class="faq-answer">Absolutely. Our Pro plan allows you to link your own custom domain (e.g., ordering.yourrestaurant.com) for a completely white-labeled experience.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-item">
                    <h3 class="faq-question">Is the 14-day trial really free?</h3>
                    <p class="faq-answer">Yes. No credit card is required to start. You get full access to all Pro features for 14 days to see if it's the right fit for your restaurant.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="pricing" class="section" style="text-align: center;">
            <span class="eyebrow">Pricing</span>
            <h2 class="display-headline section-headline">Simple, transparent pricing.</h2>
            <p class="body-text" style="margin: 0 auto 60px;">Start free for 14 days. No credit card required. Zero commission on orders.</p>

            <div class="grid">
                <div class="card">
                    <h3 class="pricing-card-title">Free</h3>
                    <div class="pricing-price">₹0<span class="pricing-unit">/month</span></div>
                    <ul class="pricing-list">
                        <li>• 1 branch</li>
                        <li>• 30 menu items</li>
                        <li>• 10 tables</li>
                        <li>• Email support</li>
                    </ul>
                    <a href="/register?plan=free" class="btn-primary" style="width: 100%;">Get Started</a>
                </div>
                <div class="card card-popular">
                    <span class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom: 8px;">Most Popular</span>
                    <h3 class="pricing-card-title">Pro</h3>
                    <div class="pricing-price">₹999<span class="pricing-unit">/month</span></div>
                    <ul class="pricing-list">
                        <li>• 3 branches</li>
                        <li>• Unlimited items</li>
                        <li>• Custom domain</li>
                        <li>• Priority support</li>
                    </ul>
                    <a href="/register?plan=pro" class="btn-primary" style="width: 100%;">Start Free Trial</a>
                </div>
                <div class="card">
                    <h3 class="pricing-card-title">Starter</h3>
                    <div class="pricing-price">₹499<span class="pricing-unit">/month</span></div>
                    <ul class="pricing-list">
                        <li>• 1 branch</li>
                        <li>• 100 menu items</li>
                        <li>• All themes</li>
                        <li>• 3 staff accounts</li>
                    </ul>
                    <a href="/register?plan=starter" class="btn-primary" style="width: 100%;">Start Free Trial</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="section cta-section">
            <h2 class="display-headline" style="font-size: 48px;">Ready to digitize your restaurant?</h2>
            <p class="body-text" style="margin: 0 auto 36px;">Join hundreds of Indian restaurants already using Mumbai Resto. Start your 14-day free trial today.</p>
            <a href="/register" class="btn-primary" style="font-size: 18px; padding: 20px 40px;">Start Your Free Trial</a>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="footer">
        <div class="container footer-container">
            <div>© 2026 MUMBAI RESTO. MADE WITH ❤️ IN INDIA.</div>
            <div class="footer-links">
                <a href="#">Privacy</a>
                <a href="#">Terms</a>
                <a href="#">Contact</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </footer>

    <script type="module" src="/js/particles.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
